Comment: Vendored upstream msi-ec kernel module (snapshot 050d4394, version
 0.13; source https://github.com/BeardOverflow/msi-ec). The DKMS layout
 requires this upstream source tree to be self-contained under
 /usr/src/msi-ec-0.13/ so the module can be compiled, which is why the
 module's LICENSE and README ship there, outside /usr/share/doc (benign
 lintian notes, not an error). The authoritative SPDX tag in msi-ec.c is
 GPL-2.0-or-later.
